# The six Learn lessons, each finished by its action (generated by tools/gen-play.mjs).
until 300 =Play
frames 10
click =Play
until 60 Modes
frames 10
click =Learn
until 60 Six lessons
frames 10
click 1. Follow the suit
until 120 Your turn
frames 10
click =7♦
until 600 Lesson complete.
frames 10
expect Follow the suit — done.
save lessons-complete
click =Next lesson
until 120 Pass 0/3
frames 10
click =Hint
frames 5
until 30 Pass 3/3
frames 5
save lessons-pass-hint
click =Pass 3/3
until 600 Lesson complete.
frames 10
expect Pass three cards — done.
click =Next lesson
until 120 Your turn
frames 10
click =2♠
until 600 Lesson complete.
frames 10
expect Duck the points — done.
click =Next lesson
until 120 Your turn
frames 10
click =Q♠
until 600 Lesson complete.
frames 10
expect Dump the Queen — done.
click =Next lesson
until 120 Your turn
frames 10
click =A♦
until 600 Lesson complete.
frames 10
expect Catch the Eclipse — done.
click =Next lesson
until 120 Your turn
frames 10
click =5♣
frames 10
key KeyU 1
until 600 Lesson complete.
frames 10
expect Second chances — done.
expect Back to lessons
click =Back to lessons
until 60 Six lessons
frames 30
save lessons-list
